<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gwalia Consolidated yr net up 26 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gwalia Consolidated yr net up 26 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 10.10 vs  7.24</p>
<p>    Net profit			 10.10 vs  8.02</p>
<p>    Sales				54.42 vs 49.73</p>
<p>    Final Dividend (cents)	   2.0 vs  2.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Gwalia Consolidated Ltd is a miner and investor. Its major asset is its 25 percent stake in major gold miner Sons of Gwalia Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
